</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER>Navigators Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>

Updated March, 2006.


Map of nav maze:



                     R
                     |
                     o
                    /
       o     o-o   o o o
        \   /   \ /  |/|
         o-o   o o o-o o
           |    \ \ \   \
           o     o-o-o o o
                /     \|\ \
               o       o o o
              / \         / \
             o   o   o   o   o
              \ /     \     /
               o   ?   o-o-o
                    \ / /
                   o o o
                    \ /
                     o


Notes:

  * Remember to have infravision before entering the maze.

  * Some walk-commands:

    'navin' is a command-aliased to 
    '4 s;2 sw;se;e;nw;e;ne;s;3 se;sw;2 w;sw;nw;enter;u;look at crystal'.
    
    'navout' is a command-alias to 
    'd;out;se;ne;2 e;ne;3 nw;n;sw;w;se;w;nw;2 ne;3 n'.



Name: The Association of Mystical Navigators
Command: navigator
Creator: Alaron
Your level: 3
Maximum level: 5


Description:

Over the centuries, the arts of mystical navigation gradually became
dispersed among the various regions and guilds of the world. However,
in this process, many spells were lost. No one guild could remembered them
all.

Then suddenly an amazing discovery was made: the original location of
training for the ancient Mystical Navigators! Due to the great powers
contained therein, only the most experienced of people are able to
join and learn the secrets of mystical navigation. To access these
abilities, one must know the world well.


Joining requirements:
 Has explored at least 15% of the world (passed)
 Must pass 1 out of the following:
  Must be maximum level in The Fellowship of Wizardry (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Blades of the Spider Queen (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Humble Druids (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Brotherhood of Wizardry (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Guild of Channellers (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Master Merchants (passed)
  Must be maximum level in Lords of Chaos (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in Evil Priests (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Bards' guild (17 out of 30)
  Must be maximum level in The Faculte of Runemagi (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Followers of Tarmalen (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Psionicists (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in Sisters of Las (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in The Conjurers (not a member)
  Must be maximum level in Guild of Alchemy (passed)
  Must be maximum level in The Cult of Reavers (not a member)
  (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 May study spell Banish to 20%
 May study spell Dimension door to 20%
 May study spell Go to 20%
 May study spell Goto ship to 20%
 May study spell Heavy weight to 20%
 May study spell Mobile cannon to 20%
 May study spell Relocate to 20%
 May study spell Summon to 20%
 May study spell Teleport with error to 20%
 May study spell Teleport without error to 20%, special requirements:
  Has studied spell Teleport with error to at least 15% (passed)
  (passed)
 May study spell Wizard eye to 20%
 May study spell Word of recall to 20%
 May train skill Cast generic to 19%
 May train skill Cast teleportation to 19%
 May train skill Location memory to 19%
 May train skill Mastery of locating to 19%
 May train skill Stargazing to 19%
 Receive the Pendant of the Navigators
 Receive the reward for joining the guild


Abilities and requirements at each level:
 Level 2:
  Requirements:
   Has explored at least 35% of the world (passed)
